  "description": {
   "en": "The 29-year-old and boyfriendless Gotou Mariko wants to get married by the age of 30 no matter what, and she's found the one! She secretly loves her handsome superior, Tomizawa Mitsuo.\n\nOne day, after rescuing a strange doll, she suddenly becomes close to Mitsuo!? She thought it was the doll's blessing(?)…\n\n“This child is called Michuko.”\n\nMariko can't believe her ears… It seems Mitsuo is no ordinary guy!?\n\n**Note:** There are 6 digital volumes to the 5 print volumes.\n___\n**Buy Physically:**\n- Amazon: [All](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B09VWMX7J3), [1](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4866693967), [2](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4866694009), [3](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4866694033), [4](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4866694041), [5](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4866694769)"
